Package: LDTL
Type: Package
Title: Linkage Disequilibrium Transfer Learning
Version: 0.2.3
Authors@R: person("Yihe", "Yang", email = "yxy1234@case.edu",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides single-source and multi-source transfer learning for
    linkage disequilibrium covariance matrices and eigenspaces. The package
    includes tuning-free covariance transfer, summary-statistic multi-source
    covariance transfer, fold-wise reconstruction-based eigenspace transfer,
    reusable large-source moment summaries, standard POET extensions, and
    conventional covariance regularizers. Large matrix operations use
    CppMatrix and native streaming kernels where possible.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: 
    R (>= 2.10)
Imports:
    CppMatrix,
    Rcpp
LinkingTo:
    Rcpp,
    RcppArmadillo
Suggests:
    RSpectra,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
